<title>USA: G&amp;K Services names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>G&amp;K Services names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>G&amp;K Services Inc on Tuesday said it named Timothy Kuck chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Before joining the uniform supply company, Kuck was president of EBPI Life Insurance Co and senior vice president of First Health, both divisions of First Data Corp.</p>
<p>Kuck, who will begin his new job May 12, is replacing Steve LaBelle, who left the company in January.</p>
<p>G&amp;K shares were up 3/4 at 30-1/4 early Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
